bleText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Paediatric ALL/LBL</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Adult ALL/LBL</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Karyotype</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.95pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid black; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Other considerations</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">AFF1</span></em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">AF4</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">, <em>MLLT2</em></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">4q21.3-q22.1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">49%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">44%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">80%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">t(4;11)(q21;q23)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Most common partner in ALL/LBL across age groups</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.2pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">MLLT3</span></em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">AF9</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">9p21.3</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">16%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">2%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">t(9;11)(p21;q23) or t(9;11)(p22;q23)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Also common in AML, particularly in paediatric and adult cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">MLLT1</span></em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\">ENL</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">19p13.3</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">22%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">12%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">t(11;19)(q23;p13.3)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Easy to miss by karyotype banding; common partner in T-ALL</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 73.2pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"98\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><em